{
  "about": "Who makes the catalog's fonts, for the app's and the site's Foundries and Designers. Google Fonts lists a family's people and foundries together as its designers; a name in foundries is an organization, and any other is a person. aliases folds one maker's spellings into one. casks gives the makers of a cask Google doesn't list, read from its fonts' name tables and checked by hand; scripts/build-catalog.py drafts one for a cask that has neither, and the fonts pull request lists the names it hasn't seen before, for review here.",
